  595                      PAGE
  596              /ROUTINE TO CALCULATE THE SHIP OUTLINE FROM CENTRAL
  597              /COORDINATES AND OUTLINE.  REQIRES THE FOLLOWING PAGE 0'S
  598              /BE PREVIOUSLY SET UP:
  599              /       QXPOS   X-CORD CENTER OF SHIP
  600              /       QYPOS   Y-CORD CENTER OF SHIP
  601              /       QSINPH  SINE OF SHIP ANGLE FROM X AXIS
  602              /       QCOSPH  COS  OF SHIP ANGLE FROM X AXIS
  603              /       QSHIP   POINTS TO START OF SHIP OUTLINE TABLE
  604              /       QSHIPN  NUMBER OF POINTS IN SHIP OUTLINE
  605              /       QTIME   OUTLINE SCALE FACTOR
  606              
  607              /IF SHIP IS NOT ALIVE OR IN HYPERSPACE THEN FAST EXIT.
  608              /COSINES AND SIGNS MUST ALLREADY BE AVAILABLE.
  609              /ALGORITHM:
  610              /       X=QXPOS + XS*COS(PH) - YS*SIN(PH)
  611              /       Y=QYPOS + XS*SIN(PH) + YS*COS(PH)
  612              /WHERE XS AND YS ARE POINTS ON SHIP OUTLINE FROM QSHIP TABLE.
  613              /THIS ROUTINE MAKES USE OF SYMMETRY
