  914              /THIS ROUTINE IS TO CALCULATE THE NEW POSITIONS
  915              /AND VELOCITIES OF A POINT ON SCREEN UNDER THE
  916              /INFLUENCE OF A THRUST AND GRAVITY.
  917              /THE ALGORITHM IS WIERD, MAINLY BECAUSE I PROBABLY
  918              /HAVE NOT FIGURED OUT THE GOOD WAY TO DO IT BUT, HERE
  919              /IS HOW THE CALCULATION PROCEEDS:
  920              /  1.   ACCELLERATION DUE TO GRAVITY IS CALCULATED VIA
  921              /       THE ROUTINE GGRAV.  THIS ROUTINE SETS UP
  922              /       QSINTH_SIN(TH)/R
  923              /       QCOSTH_COS(TH)/R
  924              /       AC_-QGRAV/R FROM LOOKUP TABLE
  925              /       WHERE TH=ANGLE WITH SUN AND R=SQROOT(X^2+Y^2)
  926              /  2.   NEW VALUES FOR THE COMPONENTS OF VELOCITY IS COMPUTED
  927              /       FROM QVX_QVX+QTHR*COS(PH)-GRAV*SIN(TH)
  928              /            QVY_QVY+QTHR*SIN(PH)-GRAV*COS(TH)
  929              /  3.   NEW VALUES OF X,Y ARE COMPUTED
  930              /       QXPOS_QXPOS+QVX*(SCALE FACTOR)
  931              /       QYPOS_QYPOS+QVY*(SCALE FACTOR)
  932              /ALSO DOES WRAP-AROUND CHECKS AND BOUNCE IF ON.
  933              
